    <div class="about-main">
      <h2>The Problem</h2>
      <p>Millions of Hindus cannot physically visit their most sacred temples. They are scattered across the world — working, aging, or simply too far. The internet exists. The streams exist. But they are scattered, low-quality, and with no real participation layer. We're changing that.</p>
      <h2>What We Are (Right Now — Phase 1)</h2>
      <p>We are a Phase 1 platform. We do exactly what we say:</p>
      <ul><li>High-quality live darshan from verified temples</li><li>Digital Sankalp — sincere personal intent, no fake rituals</li><li>Daan — honest donations to verified causes</li><li>Festival Calendar with real 2025–26 verified dates</li><li>Daily Panchang for Varanasi</li></ul>
      <h2>What We Are NOT (Yet)</h2>
      <p>Until we have real partnerships with real pandits, we will not offer puja fulfillment. The Puja Sewa page is our Phase 2 preview — bookings are accepted but will be individually coordinated.</p>
      <div class="roadmap-v2">
        <div class="rmv2-phase rmv2-phase--now"><div class="rmv2-dot">✓</div><div><h4>Phase 1 — Now</h4><p>Livestream darshan · Digital Sankalp · Daan · Festival calendar · Panchang</p></div></div>
        <div class="rmv2-phase rmv2-phase--next"><div class="rmv2-dot">→</div><div><h4>Phase 2 — In Progress</h4><p>Independent pandit network · Puja booking with proof video · Prasad delivery</p></div></div>
        <div class="rmv2-phase"><div class="rmv2-dot">◎</div><div><h4>Phase 3 — Future</h4><p>Temple partnerships (Kashi Vishwanath, Tirumala) · Premium ritual tiers · Mobile app</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <h2 id="contact">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>📧 <a href="mailto:namaste@mandir.world">namaste@mandir.world</a></p>
      <p id="partner">We welcome temple partnerships, pandit registrations, and investor conversations.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-side">
      <div class="info-box info-box--saffron"><h3>Our Commitment</h3><p>We will never fake temple partnerships. We will never claim to perform rituals we do not perform. We earn trust before we monetize it.</p></div>
      <div class="info-box"><h3>Cities We Cover</h3><ul><li>🕉️ Varanasi (Kashi)</li><li>🏹 Ayodhya</li><li>🌊 Haridwar</li><li>🦚 Mathura / Vrindavan</li><li>🛕 Puri, Kedarnath, Badrinath</li><li>🌺 Tirupati, Madurai (streams only)</li></ul></div>
